WEBVTT

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:13.840
Aroma! Mikan! That was amazing! Congratulations!

00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:15.080
Th–Thanks!

00:00:15.080 --> 00:00:16.590
But, you didn't...

00:00:17.470 --> 00:00:19.060
Don't worry-garu!

00:00:19.060 --> 00:00:21.250
Garuru's gonna catch right up to you!

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:25.070
If I fail today, then tomorrow!
If I fail tomorrow, then the next day!

00:00:25.070 --> 00:00:27.120
No matter what, there's always a tomorrow!

00:00:27.490 --> 00:00:29.090
That's the earthbound spirit!

00:00:29.090 --> 00:00:33.480
Garumageddon will pass through Hell itself if it needs to, and enter the Divine Idol Grand Prix!

00:00:33.480 --> 00:00:35.790
We'll be waiting for you!

00:00:36.340 --> 00:00:39.640
Garumageddon is invincible!

00:00:42.610 --> 00:00:43.630
Hello, all.

00:00:45.550 --> 00:00:48.480
We have some big news to announce.

00:00:48.480 --> 00:00:53.780
The second round of the Divine Idol Grand Prix will be held next week!

00:00:56.480 --> 00:00:58.220
Ça va bien!

00:00:58.220 --> 00:01:03.070
And all idols are at the start line together, none Eiffel Towering over another.

00:01:03.070 --> 00:01:06.680
Idols from beyond Parajuku are welcome as well.

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:11.300
Please participate and put your best foot forward!

00:01:12.990 --> 00:01:14.720
Okay!

00:01:16.860 --> 00:01:19.450
Keep those entries coming!

00:01:22.880 --> 00:01:24.780
Unfortunately,

00:01:24.780 --> 00:01:27.640
we cannot accept your entry to the Divine Idol Grand Prix.

00:01:27.640 --> 00:01:29.620
Why-garu?

00:01:29.620 --> 00:01:33.700
Garuru didn't get a Super Cyalume Coord...

00:01:33.700 --> 00:01:35.090
Is that why?

00:01:35.090 --> 00:01:37.630
Garuru is a part of Garumageddon!

00:01:37.630 --> 00:01:38.670
We're a team!

00:01:38.670 --> 00:01:41.070
Don't incur a demon's wrath!
You'd trick an angel?

00:01:41.070 --> 00:01:46.030
That's not it. Even if Garuru
attained a Super Cyalume Coord,

00:01:46.030 --> 00:01:49.690
Garumageddon cannot enter the Divine Idol Grand Prix.

00:01:49.690 --> 00:01:51.040
What? Why?

00:01:51.040 --> 00:01:55.090
Garumageddon has not been formally registered as a team.

00:01:55.090 --> 00:01:58.340
Please complete the team formation ceremony first.

00:02:01.400 --> 00:02:02.930
It's the system!

00:02:05.170 --> 00:02:06.520
Okay-garu!

00:03:42.500 --> 00:03:45.620
Garuru's gonna do the team formation ceremony-garu.

00:03:45.620 --> 00:03:49.680
It's not that easy. Thine essence
cannot sustain a ticket-snapping.

00:03:49.680 --> 00:03:51.420
Nopies!

00:03:51.420 --> 00:03:52.810
You two are really close.

00:03:53.900 --> 00:03:55.740
Is Garuru in the way?

00:03:55.740 --> 00:03:57.410
Of course not!

00:03:57.410 --> 00:04:00.130
Then, am I holding you back?

00:04:00.130 --> 00:04:01.510
No, you're not!

00:04:01.780 --> 00:04:04.470
Then why won't you form a team with me?

00:04:04.470 --> 00:04:07.800
I'll be fine! I want to be a team!

00:04:09.070 --> 00:04:10.250
What?

00:04:10.250 --> 00:04:13.920
You want me to attend your team formation ceremony?

00:04:13.920 --> 00:04:15.490
What are you <i>talking</i> about?

00:04:15.490 --> 00:04:17.610
Of course I won't!

00:04:17.610 --> 00:04:20.570
Garuru, do you understand?

00:04:20.570 --> 00:04:25.070
You snap Friend Tickets and trade them in the ceremony.

00:04:25.070 --> 00:04:27.920
To a Vocal Doll, born in PriPara,

00:04:27.920 --> 00:04:30.430
a PriTicket is your life itself.

00:04:30.430 --> 00:04:36.810
If you snapped a PriTicket, you might fall into a deep sleep just like Falulu did!

00:04:38.770 --> 00:04:43.870
If that happened, we'd suffer more than eternal paradise.

00:04:43.870 --> 00:04:49.200
We both love you a lot, and that's why we're worried about you!

00:04:49.200 --> 00:04:52.350
Garuru can snap a PriTicket! I know I won't fall!

00:04:52.650 --> 00:04:55.310
Even the unparalleled <i>Falulu</i> fell, you know!

00:04:55.800 --> 00:05:00.300
For a bottom-rung girl like you, it might as well be suicide!

00:05:00.300 --> 00:05:04.970
Lala. Shion. And everyone else.
They all made a team with their beloved friends.

00:05:04.970 --> 00:05:07.550
I want to make a team with Aroma and Mikan!

00:05:08.260 --> 00:05:10.600
Like everyone else!

00:05:10.600 --> 00:05:15.610
But you're <i>not</i> like everyone else!
You're different from normal girls!

00:05:15.610 --> 00:05:20.740
There are those who yearn to be a shining idol, but fail.

00:05:20.740 --> 00:05:22.920
They can't become the girl they want to be.

00:05:22.920 --> 00:05:28.500
Their pain and frustration welled up, and you were born.

00:05:28.500 --> 00:05:30.000
Garuru...

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:32.130
You're not a normal girl!

00:05:33.130 --> 00:05:36.260
You're wrong! I <i>became</i> a normal girl!

00:05:36.260 --> 00:05:37.940
I'm normal now-garu!

00:05:37.940 --> 00:05:42.270
Aroma and Mikan became friends with me.
Like any other girl!

00:05:43.210 --> 00:05:44.400
That made me happy!

00:05:48.730 --> 00:05:52.490
There's no point being an idol if Garumageddon can't be a team!

00:05:52.490 --> 00:05:53.950
I'll quit being an idol!

00:05:53.950 --> 00:05:55.410
I'll quit PriPara!

00:05:59.630 --> 00:06:02.940
I won't fall down! Even if I snap a PriTicket!

00:06:02.940 --> 00:06:05.550
I won't! It won't happen, I know it!

00:06:05.550 --> 00:06:09.510
No! Why won't you <i>listen</i> to me?

00:06:11.810 --> 00:06:12.990
O fanged apostle.

00:06:13.700 --> 00:06:16.690
Thou art truly a devil's kin.

00:06:16.690 --> 00:06:19.630
That's Aroma's bestest compliment!

00:06:19.630 --> 00:06:22.320
Hey! No! What are you saying?

00:06:22.320 --> 00:06:25.810
Your feelings are the most important of all!

00:06:25.810 --> 00:06:26.850
Yep!

00:06:26.850 --> 00:06:28.650
Aroma! Mikan!

00:06:28.650 --> 00:06:30.360
Stop it!

00:06:30.360 --> 00:06:35.100
Let us determine the future through prophecy! Demon, demon, deruderubi!

00:06:35.710 --> 00:06:38.110
Accursed... demon!

00:06:39.780 --> 00:06:43.400
The cards predict great luck! Rejoice, Unicorn!

00:06:44.590 --> 00:06:47.540
We can hold the ceremony with Neko-nee in attendance.

00:06:47.540 --> 00:06:48.770
Yeppers!

00:06:48.770 --> 00:06:50.510
Stop! Wait!

00:06:52.860 --> 00:06:55.450
Garuru did what?

00:06:56.020 --> 00:06:58.140
She's gone to perform the ceremony?

00:06:58.140 --> 00:07:00.520
What?

00:07:01.390 --> 00:07:03.710
Neko neko nekon...

00:07:03.710 --> 00:07:06.370
Neko-nee! We're going to hold the team formation ceremony!

00:07:06.370 --> 00:07:08.100
Come and attend it for us!

00:07:08.100 --> 00:07:08.820
Garu!

00:07:11.560 --> 00:07:12.530
I thought so.

00:07:13.180 --> 00:07:15.860
I always knew this day would come-nekon.

00:07:16.600 --> 00:07:18.180
So it was today-neko.

00:07:19.620 --> 00:07:20.540
But, you know...

00:07:21.380 --> 00:07:23.210
Who do you take me fur?

00:07:23.210 --> 00:07:26.340
I won't let you. I swear on my life, I'll stop you.

00:07:27.520 --> 00:07:28.800
Devi! Geru! Garu!

00:07:28.800 --> 00:07:32.670
We suspected you might say that. All as prophecised!
Devi! Geru! Garu!

00:07:32.670 --> 00:07:34.340
Please bear with us!
Devi! Geru! Garu!

00:07:34.340 --> 00:07:41.940
Devi! Geru! Garu!

00:07:42.120 --> 00:07:46.190
Who knows what could happen if she snaps PriTickets?

00:07:46.190 --> 00:07:47.580
Understood!

00:07:55.450 --> 00:07:56.900
Doncha worry!

00:07:56.900 --> 00:08:01.010
I went and bought lots of stuff for luck and long life.

00:08:01.010 --> 00:08:05.870
Orange you glad? We'll do whatever it takes to kelp you.

00:08:05.870 --> 00:08:10.340
With all this, the heavens will definitely smile upon us!

00:08:11.950 --> 00:08:13.590
Quit messing around-nekon!

00:08:14.580 --> 00:08:16.050
Hey, a sunflower seed.

00:08:19.040 --> 00:08:20.280
They lead over there!

00:08:22.480 --> 00:08:25.400
We'll be hoping and crane for you with soba.

00:08:25.400 --> 00:08:28.640
That's what history has tortoise!

00:08:28.640 --> 00:08:32.070
Cranes and tortoises are bringers of long life.

00:08:32.070 --> 00:08:35.780
You don't need to worry!
Garuru's not gonna get knocked down.

00:08:35.780 --> 00:08:37.860
We realise that!

00:08:37.860 --> 00:08:38.700
It's just...

00:08:39.480 --> 00:08:41.370
We're just making super duper sure.

00:08:41.370 --> 00:08:45.010
You're our precious demon's kin, after all.

00:08:46.500 --> 00:08:48.710
I spy with my little eye... Garumageddon!

00:08:50.290 --> 00:08:51.820
You can't!

00:08:51.820 --> 00:08:53.010
Garuru!

00:08:53.010 --> 00:08:54.090
It's perilous!

00:08:56.010 --> 00:08:57.760
You thrice-damned grimalkin!

00:08:57.760 --> 00:09:02.940
Incendiary magic: Aromat Nosferatu Humbaba!

00:09:10.890 --> 00:09:11.560
Halt...

00:09:11.560 --> 00:09:12.350
Wait...

00:09:12.350 --> 00:09:14.070
Pri-ease stop...

00:09:19.760 --> 00:09:21.480
Mikan, hold on!

00:09:21.480 --> 00:09:23.230
Can't hear you!

00:09:23.230 --> 00:09:25.730
Aroma! Stop and think this through!

00:09:25.730 --> 00:09:28.000
You're better than this-pri!

00:09:29.070 --> 00:09:30.770
Garuru...

00:09:30.770 --> 00:09:31.640
Garu.

00:09:34.400 --> 00:09:38.830
To save my kin... my power knows no bounds!

00:09:47.090 --> 00:09:47.900
They're gone.

00:09:53.000 --> 00:09:54.780
The museum?

00:09:59.960 --> 00:10:01.360
We're here.

00:10:01.360 --> 00:10:04.460
Now to get Garuru and take her home.

00:10:04.460 --> 00:10:08.000
I can't... I can't let her snap a PriTicket!

00:10:11.640 --> 00:10:12.690
Garuru...

00:10:15.950 --> 00:10:16.940
Falulu!

00:10:20.190 --> 00:10:21.330
Where's Garuru?

00:10:21.330 --> 00:10:23.490
Garuru! Where did she go?

00:10:23.490 --> 00:10:25.310
It looks like she went to the museum.

00:10:25.310 --> 00:10:28.990
"Looks like"? Listen, you, this is a matter of life and death!

00:10:28.990 --> 00:10:29.980
Unicorn.

00:10:29.980 --> 00:10:30.520
Hm?!

00:10:31.140 --> 00:10:35.730
When I snapped a Friend Ticket, I fell...

00:10:35.730 --> 00:10:38.320
but everyone helped me get back up!

00:10:38.320 --> 00:10:43.740
So if Garuru falls this time, I want to be there for her!

00:10:43.740 --> 00:10:44.490
Hey...

00:10:44.490 --> 00:10:47.020
<i>You</i> were asleep for the whole thing, of course...

00:10:47.020 --> 00:10:49.520
But <i>we</i> were pri darn worried, you know!

00:10:51.180 --> 00:10:53.020
That's right...

00:10:53.620 --> 00:10:55.130
Thank you all.

00:10:55.130 --> 00:11:01.100
It was a miracle... the miracle of all miracles that you were revived!

00:11:01.100 --> 00:11:07.560
It must have been because you were born from girls' hopes and dreams!

00:11:07.560 --> 00:11:14.880
If Garuru does it, she'll never wake up again, I just know it!

00:11:21.960 --> 00:11:22.920
Still...

00:11:23.650 --> 00:11:24.760
Even so...

00:11:30.010 --> 00:11:31.440
Garuru...

00:11:32.940 --> 00:11:34.730
All preparations are in place.

00:11:34.730 --> 00:11:37.540
Garuru won't fall into eternal slumber with all this!

00:11:37.540 --> 00:11:40.280
Quit worrying! Garuru's gonna be fine!

00:11:40.280 --> 00:11:45.180
We don't want you to meat bun any misfortune, so I brought heaps of lucky charms!

00:11:45.180 --> 00:11:47.640
Let's eat them together later!

00:11:49.730 --> 00:11:51.150
Mmph! Mmph!

00:11:51.940 --> 00:11:53.480
Is it uncomfortable?

00:11:53.480 --> 00:11:55.390
Let me take it off for you!

00:11:56.720 --> 00:11:59.540
I now understand your feelings well-neko.

00:11:59.540 --> 00:12:02.890
I'll help you with the ceremony-neko.

00:12:04.430 --> 00:12:07.200
Thank you, Neko-nee!

00:12:15.500 --> 00:12:18.600
A cat's whiskers bring good luck as well.

00:12:18.600 --> 00:12:22.880
That means my very life is pledged to protecting Garuru-neko!

00:12:23.410 --> 00:12:24.840
Neko-nee!

00:12:25.180 --> 00:12:28.000
Now all the preparations are complete.

00:12:28.000 --> 00:12:29.340
The ceremony begins.

00:12:29.340 --> 00:12:30.420
Garu!
Geru!

00:12:35.690 --> 00:12:38.150
HA-HA

00:12:38.150 --> 00:12:40.830
Those cheeky brats, they tricked us!

00:12:40.830 --> 00:12:45.610
Why, oh why is my precious Garuru going to be taken away from me?

00:12:47.200 --> 00:12:48.200
Unicorn!

00:12:49.420 --> 00:12:51.500
Oh, she has to be somewhere!

00:12:55.100 --> 00:12:56.500
Maybe...

00:13:05.600 --> 00:13:08.220
<i>Please, let her be here...</i>

00:13:08.220 --> 00:13:11.300
<i>That precious place, where I...</i>

00:13:24.830 --> 00:13:26.420
Sophie's pri-diction was right–

00:13:26.420 --> 00:13:26.890
Shh.

00:13:27.560 --> 00:13:29.450
Let's go and grab her already.

00:13:29.880 --> 00:13:31.800
The time is at hand.

00:13:31.800 --> 00:13:34.290
To hold the team formation ceremony.

00:13:35.420 --> 00:13:36.810
Yep, it's time!

00:13:39.800 --> 00:13:40.740
Garu...

00:13:41.760 --> 00:13:42.940
What ails you?

00:13:42.940 --> 00:13:44.850
Are you afeared at the last?

00:13:44.850 --> 00:13:45.790
No.

00:13:46.690 --> 00:13:48.680
I have to ask.

00:13:48.680 --> 00:13:52.640
Please think about it one more time.

00:13:54.110 --> 00:13:56.940
Garuru can't dance well.

00:13:56.940 --> 00:13:58.440
Garuru's a terrible singer.

00:13:59.600 --> 00:14:01.660
I know I'll hold you back.

00:14:02.500 --> 00:14:05.550
If we're a team, you won't rank up.

00:14:06.410 --> 00:14:07.780
I'll be nothing but trouble!

00:14:09.410 --> 00:14:12.490
Do you really... want me?

00:14:14.780 --> 00:14:16.490
You're so silly, Garuru!

00:14:16.490 --> 00:14:18.560
It's <i>gotta</i> be you!

00:14:18.560 --> 00:14:20.700
Of course we want you!

00:14:27.080 --> 00:14:29.760
Let Mikan, thee and I wander purgatory forever.

00:14:31.390 --> 00:14:33.700
I really... really...

00:14:33.700 --> 00:14:36.180
love Garumageddon-garu!

00:14:36.430 --> 00:14:39.650
It's the greatest team ever-garu!

00:14:40.060 --> 00:14:42.480
Garu!

00:14:42.490 --> 00:14:46.030
Garu! Garu!

00:14:49.630 --> 00:14:52.830
Promise: Believe in friendship.

00:14:54.170 --> 00:14:56.620
Rhythm: Carved in our hearts.

00:14:58.290 --> 00:14:59.930
Paradise: Our goal.

00:14:59.930 --> 00:15:03.250
Pega!

00:15:09.450 --> 00:15:12.670
I won't let you complete the team formation ceremony!

00:15:12.670 --> 00:15:14.190
Now, Garuru!

00:15:14.190 --> 00:15:15.710
Wait!

00:15:15.710 --> 00:15:18.020
Please, Unicorn! Let her snap her PriTicket!

00:15:18.020 --> 00:15:19.250
Never!

00:15:19.250 --> 00:15:20.180
Unicorn.

00:15:22.830 --> 00:15:23.730
Please...

00:15:24.610 --> 00:15:26.120
Let her snap it.

00:15:27.700 --> 00:15:28.940
Falulu...

00:15:29.970 --> 00:15:32.170
Paradise: Our goal!

00:15:40.200 --> 00:15:53.630
Garu!

00:15:53.630 --> 00:15:56.750
I became... a normal girl... garu...

00:15:59.400 --> 00:16:01.150
I'm not... gonna fall...

00:16:02.940 --> 00:16:04.750
I became...

00:16:13.390 --> 00:16:15.300
Garuru!

00:16:33.770 --> 00:16:34.460
Yes!

00:16:35.160 --> 00:16:36.110
Garuru!

00:16:36.760 --> 00:16:37.800
You called?

00:16:39.560 --> 00:16:40.590
Garuru!

00:16:41.370 --> 00:16:43.900
Garuru!

00:16:44.490 --> 00:16:46.240
I'm so glad!

00:16:46.590 --> 00:16:49.870
Hey, I don't think Garuru's the one in critical condition.

00:16:53.070 --> 00:16:55.820
It hurts!

00:16:57.690 --> 00:16:59.340
Garuru!

00:16:59.340 --> 00:17:01.730
Garuru! Garu... Garuru... Ga.

00:17:01.730 --> 00:17:02.970
Oh, <i>Garuru</i>!

00:17:06.340 --> 00:17:09.520
Thank goodness! I'm so, so glad!

00:17:13.640 --> 00:17:18.190
But why was Garuru fine?
Even though she snapped her precious PriTickets...

00:17:18.190 --> 00:17:20.100
I don't know.

00:17:20.100 --> 00:17:26.350
Maybe it's because, unlike me, she's held such powerful emotions ever since she was born...

00:17:26.810 --> 00:17:28.860
It certainly is curious.

00:17:28.860 --> 00:17:34.830
Perhaps it's simply because she became friends with Aroma and Mikan, after all.

00:17:34.830 --> 00:17:36.820
Oh, de vie en rose!

00:17:38.410 --> 00:17:39.320
Jululu!

00:17:48.040 --> 00:17:51.530
We swear to stand on stage as one!

00:17:53.340 --> 00:17:56.510
Scan the appropriate number of MyTickets for your coord.

00:17:56.510 --> 00:17:58.980
You can also scan each other's Friend Tickets.

00:17:58.980 --> 00:18:01.010
Starting the Coord Change.

00:18:02.820 --> 00:18:06.620
It's LoveDevi, the brand born from the trio's friendship.

00:18:06.620 --> 00:18:07.810
Garumageddon...

00:18:07.810 --> 00:18:08.830
Pink Heart...

00:18:08.830 --> 00:18:09.950
Blue Club...

00:18:09.950 --> 00:18:11.000
Red Diamond...

00:18:11.000 --> 00:18:12.170
Coord!

00:18:12.170 --> 00:18:13.110
Geru!
Devi!
Garu!

00:18:13.790 --> 00:18:14.730
Garuru!

00:18:14.730 --> 00:18:16.720
Aroma! You're so wonderful!

00:18:16.720 --> 00:18:19.460
Mikan-chan! Fly me to Heaven!

00:18:19.460 --> 00:18:21.440
Garuru, please bite me!

00:18:22.000 --> 00:18:23.300
Darkness!

00:18:23.300 --> 00:18:26.050
Servants of the devil, you shall be cursed!

00:18:27.870 --> 00:18:29.300
Shining!

00:18:29.300 --> 00:18:31.760
Heaven's blessing be upon everyone!

00:18:32.010 --> 00:18:33.260
Howling!

00:18:33.260 --> 00:18:35.240
A full moon bathing the night-garu!

00:18:35.620 --> 00:18:36.440
Devil!

00:18:36.440 --> 00:18:37.700
Angel!

00:18:37.700 --> 00:18:39.580
And beast together!

00:18:39.580 --> 00:18:42.340
We are Garumageddon!

00:18:42.340 --> 00:18:43.440
Garu!

00:19:58.450 --> 00:19:59.710
Garu!

00:19:59.710 --> 00:20:03.300
Making Drama, switch on!

00:20:04.910 --> 00:20:06.140
Garu!

00:20:09.940 --> 00:20:11.450
Onward!

00:20:11.450 --> 00:20:12.640
Geru!

00:20:17.690 --> 00:20:20.490
Mischievous Macaroon Factory!

00:20:20.490 --> 00:20:22.180
Geru! Geru!

00:20:22.180 --> 00:20:23.570
Garu!

00:20:23.880 --> 00:20:26.530
Cyalume Change!

00:20:32.690 --> 00:20:33.640
Garu!

00:21:11.200 --> 00:21:13.920
Now, to the Divine Idol stage!

00:21:14.540 --> 00:21:17.720
Divine Idol Challenge, switch on!

00:21:17.720 --> 00:21:18.850
Garu!

00:21:18.850 --> 00:21:22.180
Divine Jewel, Cyalume Jewel Mic!

00:21:22.180 --> 00:21:26.110
Let the challenge commence...
to become a Divine Idol!

00:21:44.770 --> 00:21:48.230
The closet's doors open for you...

00:21:48.230 --> 00:21:50.960
Within is a coord fit for a Divine Idol!

00:21:59.280 --> 00:22:01.290
Garuru! You're shining!

00:22:01.290 --> 00:22:03.260
Congratulations!

00:22:03.260 --> 00:22:06.860
Garu! Aru! Aru!

00:22:06.860 --> 00:22:09.450
Congratulations on forming a team!

00:22:09.450 --> 00:22:11.470
Garuru!

00:22:11.470 --> 00:22:13.460
I did it-Garu!

00:22:13.460 --> 00:22:14.760
Yep, you did!

00:22:14.760 --> 00:22:17.280
Garumageddon's a real team-garu!

00:22:17.280 --> 00:22:19.900
We did it, we did it!

00:23:52.030 --> 00:23:55.090
Jululu's true form has been revealed!

00:23:55.090 --> 00:23:58.340
Mon amour. This predicament concerns all of PriPara!

00:23:58.340 --> 00:24:00.560
We must think of a way to undo this.

00:24:00.560 --> 00:24:02.450
The Grand Prix is in peril.

00:24:02.450 --> 00:24:05.040
I should clarify: I am Parajuku's Meganii.

00:24:05.040 --> 00:24:08.220
Oui, monsieur. And I am PriParis's Meganii.

00:24:08.220 --> 00:24:09.720
It's so hard to tell!

00:24:09.720 --> 00:24:13.520
And so, next time:
<i>The Divine Idol Grand Prix Is Terminated.</i>

00:24:13.520 --> 00:24:14.500
What?

00:24:14.500 --> 00:24:16.780
And Garumageddon is disbanded!

00:24:16.780 --> 00:24:17.940
What?

00:24:17.940 --> 00:24:19.080
Don't <i>celebrate</i> it!

00:24:19.080 --> 00:24:19.720
Garu!
